OL,3,GNEWSAEx-ambulance call handler saves
OL,4,Acollapsed man's life after spotting his
OL,5,Adogs
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman "undoubtedly saved" a
OL,8,Fstranger's life after he collapsed and
OL,9,Fwent into cardiac arrest while walking
OL,10,Fhis dogs.
OL,12,FRachel Green was driving to the gym
OL,13,Fthrough the village of Sully, Vale of
OL,14,FGlamorgan, in December 2025, when she
OL,15,Fnoticed the two unattended Shih-Tzus
OL,16,Fand pulled over to find 75-year-old
OL,17,FAlan Hale collapsed face down on the
OL,18,Fpavement.
OL,20,FHale was in cardiac arrest and Green
OL,21,Fcalled 999 and began chest
OL,22,Fcompressions.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
